 "subtitles": [
  {
   "start": 0.61,
   "end": 6.146,
   "text": "Across government, AI agents are beginning to work together on citizen services:"
  },
  {
   "start": 6.146,
   "end": 10.09,
   "text": "checking eligibility, sharing tasks, and collecting fees."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.35,
   "end": 15.17,
   "text": "But what happens when a legitimate agent, with a genuine identity,"
  },
  {
   "start": 15.17,
   "end": 19.395,
   "text": "reaches for another citizen's record, one it was never authorized to see?"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.702,
   "end": 25.314,
   "text": "WAKALA checks every request against signed, case-specific authority."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.564,
   "end": 27.143,
   "text": "In our working prototype,"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.143,
   "end": 30.998,
   "text": "the request is blocked before any protected data is returned."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.35,
   "end": 35.815,
   "text": "An authorized security officer reviews the incident,"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.815,
   "end": 41.413,
   "text": "contains only the affected authority, and hands the task to a trusted standby agent."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.369,
   "end": 46.581,
   "text": "After the required approval, Mariam's renewal completes safely,"
  },
  {
   "start": 46.581,
   "end": 52.331,
   "text": "every decision stays on record, and another citizen's application continues untouched."
  },
  {
   "start": 53.901,
   "end": 58.799,
   "text": "WAKALA. Autonomous AI. Accountable actions."
  }
 ]
